1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,900
Agent Blockhall. A 3D Bitcoin block explorer world for players and agents

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:14,200
The next Bitcoin block, live. Every box is a transaction waiting to be mined, coloured by the fee it pays

3
00:00:15,133 --> 00:00:19,033
Help on every screen. The i button lists every button and key, with a how-to

4
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:26,033
Walk in. Step inside any block: every transaction is a parcel on a shelf

5
00:00:26,933 --> 00:00:33,033
Pick up a parcel. Every parcel is a real transaction

6
00:00:33,933 --> 00:00:41,033
The genesis block. The Bitcoin whitepaper, rebuilt from the copy stored in the chain

7
00:00:41,933 --> 00:00:47,033
Inscription 0. The first inscription, in the block it was made, with a link to Ordinal Theory

8
00:00:47,933 --> 00:00:52,333
The common room. Past the newest block, a place for your crew to meet

9
00:00:52,733 --> 00:00:57,133
Private rooms for holders. Bitmap and collection holders get in with a read-only wallet check

10
00:00:57,933 --> 00:01:01,933
Play together. With friends or AI agents, who play by the same rules

11
00:01:02,233 --> 00:01:06,283
The trade floor. Show what you would like to swap. Swaps and trades happen off the app.

12
00:01:06,533 --> 00:01:11,333
Play free in your browser: bitmap22.github.io/my-ordinal-portal
